[node name="Documents" type="Node3D" parent="Gameplay" unique_id=165434854]

[node name="PumpRoomLog" type="Area3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents" unique_id=1777630516]
transform = Transform3D(-4.371139e-08, 0, -1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, -4.371139e-08, 6.83, -2.6, -17)
script = ExtResource("6_55c5i")
document_id = &"pump_room_log"
title = "Pump room log"
text = "Night log, pump room.
The culvert floods every storm, and the storm drain grate jams shut until it is pumped dry.
To drain it: free the crank first (it seizes; use the tool kit), open the two outer valves, keep the middle valve SHUT, then pull START. Any other setting stalls the pump with a bang you can hear upstairs.
— Facilities, night shift"
discovers_objective = &"drain_culvert"
metadata/zone_id = "G"

[node name="Shape" type="CollisionShape3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents/PumpRoomLog" unique_id=1173135354]
shape = SubResource("BoxShape_0p500_0p600_0p300")

[node name="ElectricalNotice" type="Area3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents" unique_id=77546657]
transform = Transform3D(-4.371139e-08, 0, -1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, -4.371139e-08, 45.83, 1.4, -24)
script = ExtResource("6_55c5i")
document_id = &"electrical_notice"
title = "Electrical room notice"
text = "NOTICE TO STAFF
The archive sub-panel is behind the screwed-on cover (the tool kit is in the maintenance bay downstairs).
The wiring chart is pinned up in Book Processing. A wrong breaker setting trips the main, loudly.
— Library facilities"
metadata/zone_id = "D"

[node name="Shape" type="CollisionShape3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents/ElectricalNotice" unique_id=2115194197]
shape = SubResource("BoxShape_0p500_0p600_0p300")

[node name="WiringChart" type="Area3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents" unique_id=1839628235]
transform = Transform3D(1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 26, 1.4, -27.83)
script = ExtResource("6_55c5i")
document_id = &"wiring_chart"
title = "Wiring chart"
text = "WIRING CHART · ARCHIVE SUB-PANEL (electrical room)
A3 VAULT LOCK feeds the vault keypad. It only holds while A4 SECURITY GRID is live (the lock reports to security).
A1 ARCHIVE LIGHTS shares A3's feed: with A1 off, the vault lock browns out.
A2 SUMP PUMP: never energise A2 from this panel while the basement is wet. It trips the main.
Set the breakers first, then engage MAIN.
— Facilities"
metadata/zone_id = "D"

[node name="Shape" type="CollisionShape3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents/WiringChart" unique_id=9875280]
shape = SubResource("BoxShape_0p500_0p600_0p300")

[node name="ArchivistMemo" type="Area3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents" unique_id=242991022]
transform = Transform3D(-4.371139e-08, 0, -1, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, -4.371139e-08, 11.83, 5.9, -20)
script = ExtResource("6_55c5i")
document_id = &"archivist_memo"
title = "Archivist's memo"
text = "MEMO · Head archivist
After the audit, security reset the vault keypad. The new code is the year this library was founded, with its digits in reverse order.
The year is on the plaque in the lobby if you forget it. Do not write the code itself down anywhere!
— M. Ortega"
metadata/zone_id = "E"

[node name="Shape" type="CollisionShape3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents/ArchivistMemo" unique_id=789317838]
