[node name="PatrolNotes" type="Area3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents" unique_id=865525143]
transform = Transform3D(-4.371139e-08, 0, 1, 0, 1, 0, -1, 0, -4.371139e-08, -5.83, 5.75, -23.3)
script = ExtResource("6_55c5i")
document_id = &"patrol_notes"
title = "Patrol notes"
text = "PATROL NOTES (security locker)
Every guard keeps to a fixed loop and stops briefly at its corners: wait for the pause, then move.
One guard walks the whole basement tunnel. An alarm draws whoever hears it to the spot. Be somewhere else by then.
The master badge in this locker overrides the night lockdown at the main entrance reader. The override takes a few seconds and the lobby camera watches the reader.
— Night shift"
available = false
metadata/zone_id = "E"

[node name="Shape" type="CollisionShape3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents/PatrolNotes" unique_id=1410608537]
shape = SubResource("BoxShape_0p500_0p600_0p300")

[node name="CulvertAccessPlan" type="Area3D" parent="Gameplay/Documents" unique_id=324553436]
transform = Transform3D(-1, 0, -8.742278e-08, 0, 1, 0, 8.742278e-08, 0, -1, -23.5, -2.6, -17.17)
script = ExtResource("6_55c5i")
document_id = &"culvert_access_plan"
title = "Culvert access plan"
text = "FACILITIES · CULVERT ACCESS
After the 2019 flood the culvert access opposite the pump room door was boarded over with a false wall panel. Its latch still works: press the panel's right-hand edge.
Beyond it the storm drain runs out under the grounds, but the grate at its end jams while the culvert is flooded. Pump it dry first.
— Facilities"
metadata/zone_id = "G"

